[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD005
TITLE: Neighbor distance selection
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall place one candidate inside the communications distance and one outside it and expect only the inside candidate to be selected as a neighbor. Acceptance is a neighbor set of size one containing the inside airport.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The boundary is the configured distance, so the test uses positions on either side of it.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: Distance is computed in nautical miles.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STP001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SRS005
- TYPE: File
  PATH: apps/atc_tower/test/atc_config_SUITE.erl
